[{"title":"跋余伯益所藏张钦夫书西铭短纸二首 其一","author":"杨万里","text":"一高一下一中央，怙恃兼侬岂别房。\n撞过烟楼休劣相，祗如郎罢也无良。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68360,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋汪省干诗卷二首 其二","author":"杨万里","text":"自古诗人太瘦生，可怜辛苦选虚名。\n诗家杂压君知么，压尽三公况九卿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68361,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋汪省干诗卷二首 其一","author":"杨万里","text":"向来刘翰有诗声，近日汪经更得名。\n月在梅花冰在月，与君句子各争清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68362,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋袁起岩所藏兰亭帖","author":"杨万里","text":"南朝千载有斯人，拈出兰亭花草春。\n俛仰之间已陈迹，至今此纸尚如新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68363,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋陈简斋奏草","author":"杨万里","text":"诗宗已上少陵坛，笔法仍抽逸少关。\n真迹总归天上去，独留奏草在人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68364,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋范文公与尹师鲁帖","author":"杨万里","text":"佳客千山得得来，主人双眼为渠开。\n逢人莫说当时事，且泊南亭把一杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68365,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋临川梁译居士孝德记二首 其二","author":"杨