浅与深，著衣吃饭送光阴。\n却缘说似痴人梦，便向汪家图里寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68372,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋淳溪汪立义大学致知图二首 其一","author":"杨万里","text":"杏坛何物是家风，只在当人阿堵中。\n谁作新图漏消息，淳溪溪上钓鱼翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68373,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋符发所录上蔡语二首 其二","author":"杨万里","text":"符君天秀擢炎方，茧足担簦学北方。\n不是澹庵谪南海，姓名那得许芬香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68374,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋黄文若诗卷","author":"杨万里","text":"五字长城璧不如，鼠肝虫臂得关渠。\n竹坡集里曾相识，惊见兰亭茧纸书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68375,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋韩魏公与尹师鲁帖","author":"杨万里","text":"侍中尺箠挞羌酋，更得河南共运筹。\n到得降书来北阙，河南骑马去均州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68376,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋虞丞相与赵撙节使帖还其犹子济二首 其一","author":"杨万里","text":"虞丞相与赵将军，同策江淮第一勋。\n大羽进贤今寂寞，凌烟颂里感风云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68377,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋虞丞相与赵撙节使帖还其犹子济二首 其二","author":"杨万里","text":"侧厘一幅落云烟，意豁神倾叹两贤。\n从古将门长出将，眼看小阮勒燕然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68378,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋澹庵先生辞工部侍郎答诏不允 其二","author":"杨万里","text":"愿挽天河洗北夷，老臣底用紫荷为。\n丹心一寸凌霜雪，祗有隆兴圣主知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68379,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋澹庵先生辞工部侍郎答诏不允 其一","author":"杨万里","text":"高卧崖州二十年，黑头去国白头还。\n身居紫禁莺花里，心在青原水石间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68380,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋澹庵先生缴张钦夫赐章服答诏二首 其二","author":"杨万里","text":"紫绶当时赐两人，一为乳臭一名臣。\n老韩不要令同传，谁会先生此意真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68381,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋澹庵先生缴张钦夫赐章服答诏二首 其一","author":"杨万里","text":"平生师友两相知，苦为君王惜一衣。\n刺口争来争不得，青蝇犹傍太阳飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68382,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道旁石榴花","author":"杨万里","text":"待阙南风欲炷香，东风打并住西堂。\n石榴已著乾红蕾，却问春归有底忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68383,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道旁店","author":"杨万里","text":"路旁野店两三家，清晓无汤况有茶。\n道是渠侬不好事，青瓷瓶插紫薇花。","collection"